config APEX_WATCHDOG
	bool "apex self-healing watchdog"
	depends on APEX
	help
	  In-kernel watchdog that checks CPU, GPU, thermal, ZRAM, and battery
	  subsystems every 5 minutes. Attempts recovery on anomaly; panics
	  after 3 consecutive failures. Exposes /proc/apex/watchdog.
	  Built-in: must run before userspace.
